{"id":"redor","lemma":"redor","pos":"noun","rank":2058,"glosses":["the area surrounding someone or something"],"ipa":"/ʁɨˈdɔɾ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6b/Pt-pt-redor.ogg/Pt-pt-redor.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"redores"},"examples":[{"text":"Quero viajar ao redor do mundo.","en":"I want to travel around the world.","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to travel"},{"g":"to the"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"non-religious"]]},{"text":"Ele é famoso ao redor do mundo.","en":"He's famous around the world.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"famous"},{"g":"to the"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"non-religious"]]},{"text":"Há algumas casas ao redor.","en":"There are a few houses around.","words":[{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"some, any","l":"algum"},{"g":"house, home","l":"casa"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Há muitas árvores ao redor da lagoa.","en":"There are a lot of trees around the pond.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/840983","words":[{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"very, a lot","l":"muito"},{"g":"tree","l":"árvore"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"pond, pool, small lake"}]},{"text":"Olhe ao seu redor.","en":"Look around.","words":[{"g":"gaze","l":"olhar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"his"},null]}]}